# Cargo
# The backend is a deployable application (a Cargo workspace whose `api` crate is a
# binary), so its Cargo.lock is committed for reproducible builds and to let the
# security audit (`.github/workflows/audit.yml`) trigger on lockfile changes.
# **/Cargo.lock
# Machine-local cargo config (e.g. `[build] jobs` cap to protect low-RAM hosts
# from OOM during full-workspace builds). Never commit per-machine settings;
# CI and other contributors must not inherit them.
**/.cargo/config.toml

# Test coverage
coverage/
*.coverage
.coverage.*

# Mutation testing
mutants.out*/

# Agent/IDE configuration directories
.pi/**
backend/.pi/plugins/ast-bro/**

# arc42 documentation build artifacts
backend/docs/architecture/arc42-typst/dist/
# Generated diagram SVGs (rendered from backend/docs/architecture/diagrams/*.puml by build.sh)
backend/docs/architecture/arc42-typst/diagrams/
